    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-little-rock-ar</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>18-month permitting halt on hyperscale data centers (250,000+ sq ft or 75+ MW), including a planned Google facility at the Port of Little Rock; failed 4-4 with two directors absent. The city&#x27;s June 3, 2026 data-center regulations (no groundwater cooling, noise monitors) remain in effect regardless.</description>
